

[00:01.27]Mary had a pretty bird
[00:09.49]Feathers bright and yellow
[00:11.38]Slender legs upon my word
[00:13.66]He was a pretty fellow
[00:15.90]The sweetest notes he always sang
[00:18.22]Which much delighted mary
[00:19.75]And often where the cage was hung
[00:23.18]He stood, to hear her canary
